  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {工夫|くふう}する (to devise, to contrive)\n- {工夫|くふう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{凝|こ}らす→凝らす：08224_korasu⟧ (to exercise ingenuity)\n- {工夫|くふう}⟦{次第|しだい}→次第：03175_shidai⟧で (depending on how you devise it)\n- {工夫|くふう}が⟦{足|た}りない→足りる：01209_tariru⟧ (lacking ingenuity)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{工夫|くふう}する\n\nUSAGE:\n- ちょっとした{工夫|くふう} (a small trick/idea)\n- ⟦{自分|じぶん}→自分：02887_jibun⟧なりの{工夫|くふう} (one's own device/method)\n- ⟦{創意|そうい}→創意：22819_soui⟧{工夫|くふう} (creative ingenuity)\n\nHOMOPHONE NOTE: {工夫|こうふ} (laborer, workman) has a different reading.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦アイデア→アイデア：10161_aidea⟧/アイディア (idea - loanword)\n- ⟦{知恵|ちえ}→知恵：03428_chie⟧ (wisdom, cleverness)\n- ⟦{方法|ほうほう}→方法：03621_houhou⟧ (method, way)",
